#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="Chef Rayhan mau kasih kejutan buat ceweknya. Langsung saja Chef Rayhan masak steak sirloin dan grill carrot. Tidak cuma daging, Chef Rayhan bakal menghidangkan chimichurri sauce di atas steak sirloinnya." director="Surya Pradito" cast="Muhammad Rayhan Akbar" serie-title="Meat and Great" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="13" tvg-logo="https://picture.dens.tv/poster/files/port/06-Portrait-VOD-Per-episode_Meat-and-Great.jpg" group-title="Meat and Great",S01E13 - Surf & Turf (Part 3)
