#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="The top poker players in the world descend on Foxwoods as the first professional league in history kicks off a $2.5 million dollar season. Greg Raymer, T.J. Cloutier, "Amarillo Slim" Preston, WPT Champions Erick Lindgren and Daniel Negreanu are showcased in this first quarter coverage of the Professional Poker Tour." serie-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="01" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788520400863-v2.jpg" group-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour",S01E01 - PPT - S01 E01: Foxwoods - 1st Quarter
