#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="Controversey, smack talk and wild swings of emotion are everywhere as the PPT picks up second quarter action at Foxwoods. It's history in the making as Josh "The Mouth" Arieh and Hoyt "Cowboy" Corkins bully the table until Annie Duke and other champions get fed up and fire back." serie-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="02" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788520400863-v2.jpg" group-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour",S01E02 - PPT - S01 E02: Foxwoods - 2nd Quarter
