#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="Can petite Jennifer Harman stand up against the bad boys? Cowboy Corkins, Ted Forrest and a host of world class pros are determined to send the blond dynamo packing. The toughest field in poker history has been whittled down to 39 of the best in the world for third quarter action of the PPT." serie-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="03" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788520400863-v2.jpg" group-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour",S01E03 - PPT - S01 E03: Foxwoods - 3rd Quarter
