#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="Aggression is the name of the game in first quarter PPT action at Bellagio. Evelyn Ng is prowling for victims, and takes no prisoners. But 230 poker greats will put up the fight of a lifetime as they grapple for the PPT trophy and title of "best of the best."" serie-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="15" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788520400863-v2.jpg" group-title="PPT Professional Poker Tour",S01E15 - PPT - S01 E15: Bellagio - 1st Quarter
