#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="A key pickleball strategy when dinking is knowing what balls to take in the air or what ball to let bounce. We want to hit comfortably so we can take away time from our opponents and maintain position on your side. The player wants to be able to dictate a dink rally by decision making and positioning." serie-title="SportsEdTV Pickleball" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="18" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788520407245-v2.jpg" group-title="SportsEdTV Pickleball",S01E18 - PICKLEBALL - E18 - DINK IN THE AIR VS BOUNCE
