#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="In this DDP's premiere episode, World Series champion Eric Hosmer announces his retirement after 13 seasons in Major League Baseball. Hosmer also holds 4 Gold Gloves, a Silver Slugger, and a World Baseball Classic championship with team USA. Additionally, Hosmer reveals his next chapter, as he teams up with his former minor league Kansas City Royals teammate, Anthony Seratelli, to launch an MLB player-owned media company focused on authentic sports storytelling: MoonBall Media." serie-title="Diggin Deep" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="01" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788519970629-v2.jpg" group-title="Diggin Deep",S01E01 - Diggin' Deep - E01: Eric Hosmer
