#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="Tatis & Profar peel back the curtains on the life of MLB players, and tell stories from their days with Hoz as teammates on the San Diego Padres. The conversation kicks off with Tatis, Profar, and Hosmer discussing the misinterpretations and pressures of traditional media, sharing personal anecdotes that reveal the human side of baseball's sparkling exterior." serie-title="Diggin Deep" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="10" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788519970629-v2.jpg" group-title="Diggin Deep",S01E10 - Diggin' Deep - E10: Fernando Tatis Jr. & Jurickson Profar
