#EXTINF:-1 vod="1" type="series" content-type="series" tvg-tmdb="" tvg-description="Once a legendary MLB player for the Kansas City Royals who transitioned into a guiding force for the next generation, underscoring the profound impact of leadership in sports. Tune in to hear how Mike Sweeney's dedication to nurturing young talent has crafted a lasting impact on the lives of many athletes, illustrating the enduring influence of a true mentor in the world of baseball." serie-title="Diggin Deep" tvg-season="01" tvg-episode="11" tvg-logo="https://gizmeon.mdc.akamaized.net/PUB-50183/thumbnails/360_540/1788519970629-v2.jpg" group-title="Diggin Deep",S01E11 - Diggin' Deep - E11: Mike Sweeney
